  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "功能性高分子實驗",
    "sub_ename": "EXPERIMENTS OF FUNCTIONAL POLYMERS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目的為介紹功能性高分子相關之實驗與分析。課程內容包含進行功能性高分子材料相關系統之樣品製備、相形態觀測、光譜鑑定、熱性質觀測等。輔以實作實驗與分析講解，以增進學習成效。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to introduce the experiments and analysis related to functional polymers. The course content includes sample preparation, phase morphology observation, spectrum identification, and thermal property observation of functional polymer materials. It is supplemented by practical experiments and analysis to enhance the effectiveness of learning.",
